#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:93
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_ChairmansYoungerBrotherOnVacation"
msgid ""
"Er-hem!\p"
"I am the POKéMON FAN CLUB's most\n"
"important person, the CHAIRMAN's\l"
"younger brother.\p"
"I'm here enjoying my vacation with\n"
"POKéMON, yes, indeed.$"
msgstr ""
"咳咳！\p"
"我是宝可梦爱好者俱乐部\n"
"最重要的人物——会长的弟弟。\p"
"我正在这里和宝可梦\n"
"一起享受假期，没错。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:101
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_AhYourPokemon"
msgid ""
"Ah!\n"
"Your POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""
"啊！\n"
"你的宝可梦……$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:105
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_AdoringPokemonTakeThis"
msgid ""
"It clearly likes you very much.\p"
"A POKéMON that adoring and adorable\n"
"deserves a TM like this, no?$"
msgstr ""
"它显然非常喜欢你。\p"
"这么亲近又可爱的宝可梦，\n"
"就该配上这样的招式学习器，对吧？$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:110
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_PutInSomeMoreEffort"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"It's not bad, but it's also not good.\p"
"You, as the TRAINER, need to put in\n"
"some more effort.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\n"
"不算坏，但也不算好。\p"
"你作为训练家，\n"
"还要再多努力一些。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_ViciousPokemonTakeThis"
msgid ""
"It has a vicious look to it.\p"
"A frightening POKéMON like that\n"
"deserves a TM like this.$"
msgstr ""
"它的眼神很凶狠。\p"
"这么可怕的宝可梦，\n"
"就该配上这样的招式学习器。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:121
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_ExplainReturnFrustration"
msgid ""
"If a POKéMON likes you a lot, RETURN's\n"
"power is enhanced.\p"
"If it doesn't like you, FRUSTRATION's\n"
"power goes up.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦越喜欢你，\n"
"报恩的威力就越大。\p"
"宝可梦越不喜欢你，\n"
"迁怒的威力就越大。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:127
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_GetGoodTMInXDays"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes. In about {STR_VAR_1} or so days,\n"
"I should be getting a good TM or two.\p"
"You should come see me then.\n"
"I'll give you a TM that's suitable for\l"
"your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，对了。再过{STR_VAR_1}天左右，\n"
"我应该会得到一两个好的招式学习器。\p"
"到时候你再来找我吧。\n"
"我会给你适合你的宝可梦的\l"
"招式学习器。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:134
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_Rurii"
msgid "AZURILL: Rurii.$"
msgstr "露力丽：噜力～$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:137
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_VeryFriendlyWithTrainer"
msgid ""
"It appears to be very friendly with the\n"
"TRAINER.$"
msgstr "它好像和训练家非常亲近。$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:141
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_Rururi"
msgid "AZURILL: Rururi!$"
msgstr "露力丽：噜噜力！$"

#: data/maps/PacifidlogTown_House2/scripts.inc:144
msgctxt "PacifidlogTown_House2_Text_DoesntLikeTrainerVeryMuch"
msgid ""
"It doesn't appear to like the TRAINER\n"
"very much.$"
msgstr "它好像不太喜欢训练家。$"
